I think that blessing a piece of armor or a weapon makes it unlikely that 
it will rust or be damaged, but I think I've had it happen anyway. 
Besides, armor can be unblessed (by liches, the Wizard, Golden Nagas, the 
Amulet) relatively easily, but it won't be unrustproofed by much, if 
anything. And if you have so many blessed scrolls of enchant armor, and 
are using them to keep your armor blessed, won't your armor eventually be 
too powerful and leave you? I personally try to rustproof an item as soon 
as I decide I'm going to take it all the way.
